"controller_mappings"
{
	"version"		"3"
	"revision"		"1"
	"title"		"Open Annihilation: keyboard and mouse"
	"description"		"Mouse and keys only, for builds without controller support or for players who want Steam's mouse: right trackpad the mouse, R2 and L2 the left and right buttons, left trackpad the wheel (zoom) and Space, left stick the arrow keys, R4 and L4 Shift (L4 latches), R5 Ctrl, L5 the group keys, R1 and L1 radial menus of the order and selection keys."
